---
layout: app-layout.njk
title: Grade Pyramid – Climbing Logbook
discipline: true
bundle: performance-pyramid
staticShellNote: |-
  Genuinely static shell (#348), same pattern as public/map/index.html
         -- see that file's own comment for why every path below is absolute
         and client/performance-pyramid-main.js reads the username from
         location.pathname itself rather than this file being templated.
---
<div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
  {% include "page-header.njk" %}

  <div class="flex items-end gap-3 mb-2" id="picker-tabs-row">
    <climbing-discipline-picker></climbing-discipline-picker>
    <climbing-tab-bar active-page="performance"></climbing-tab-bar>
  </div>

  <a class="back-link mt-4 mb-5" id="back-to-performance-link" href="#">
    <svg class="w-[.9rem] h-[.9rem] stroke-current fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg>
    Performance Insights
  </a>

  <h1 class="page-title">Grade Pyramid</h1>

  <div class="mb-5" id="view-explainer">
    <p class="text-[.95rem] text-foreground leading-[1.7]">How your sends stack up by grade — a shape that shows whether your base can support the ceiling you're pushing toward.</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted leading-[1.7] mt-2">Built from every send's <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold">grade</strong> — no attempts, exertion, or notes factored in, just how many climbs you closed out at each level.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-end mb-4">
    <div id="report-grade-scale-root"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="row-card text-center max-w-[420px] mx-auto" id="performance-offline" hidden>
    <p class="text-[.9rem] text-foreground">Performance insights need a connection.</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted mt-2">Reconnect and reload this page to see your Grade Pyramid.</p>
  </div>

  <climbing-grade-pyramid></climbing-grade-pyramid>

  <div class="text-center text-muted text-[.78rem] mt-8" id="footer"></div>
</div>
